Severity: WARN
Category: filesystem
Check: check_storage
Fix: chmod 640 the locate database, owned by root and its group.
References: updatedb(8)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The locate database is readable by strangers. Its filenames
name every file on the box, and every account with a home.
Leave it to root and its group alone.
